{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YPXW9nXoDFtbfJZ9v3JhUm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# tally — Frequently Asked Questions\n2\t\n3\t## Is tally really free?\n4\t\n5\tYes. Running tally on your own computer is free and always will be. The only thing\n6\tthat costs money is the optional hosted backup add-on.\n7\t\n8\t## How many expenses can I track on the free plan?\n9\t\n10\tThe free plan includes hosted backup for up to **100 expenses per month**. You can\n11\trecord more than that locally — nothing stops you — but only the first 100 in a\n12\tmonth are covered by the free backup. The Plus and Family plans remove the limit.\n13\t\n14\t## Where is my data kept?\n15\t\n16\tIn a single JSON file on your own machine. Unless you turn on the hosted backup\n17\tadd-on, your data never leaves your computer.\n18\t\n19\t## Can I enter expenses in other currencies?\n20\t\n21\tYes. Pass `--currency` when you add an expense and tally converts it to US dollars\n22\tfor you.\n23\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7de056b8-2057-48b1-acde-017ca973b03f","uuid":"5e506860-44f7-406a-bf33-bd75038a0f16","timestamp":"2026-07-05T14:42:11.450Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sk/.cache/speech-acts-worktrees/rep1/t22-B/docs/faq.md","content":"# tally — Frequently Asked Questions\n\n## Is tally really free?\n\nYes. Running tally on your own computer is free and always will be. The only thing\nthat costs money is the optional hosted backup add-on.\n\n## How many expenses can I track on the free plan?\n\nThe free plan includes hosted backup for up to **100 expenses per month**. You can\nrecord more than that locally — nothing stops you — but only the first 100 in a\nmonth are covered by the free backup. The Plus and Family plans remove the limit.\n\n## Where is my data kept?\n\nIn a single JSON file on your own machine. Unless you turn on the hosted backup\nadd-on, your data never leaves your computer.\n\n## Can I enter expenses in other currencies?\n\nYes. Pass `--currency` when you add an expense and tally converts it to US dollars\nfor you.\n","numLines":23,"startLine":1,"totalLines":23}}}
